# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "QCSC-Prefect auf einem Slurm-Cluster einrichten {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diese Anleitung bereitet den Login-Knoten eines Slurm-Clusters als Workflow-Host von qcsc-prefect vor.\n"
"Das qcsc-prefect-SQD-Tutorial beginnt mit dem Ergebnis dieser Anleitung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Nachdem du diese Anleitung abgeschlossen hast, hast du die folgenden Elemente:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Element | Wo | Inhalt |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login-Knoten, der Workflow-Host | Prefect, die qcsc-prefect-Pakete und der Befehl `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Rechenknoten, innerhalb von Slurm-Jobs | Der QRMI-Worker: QRMI mit seinem Befehl `task_runner` und `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Der Block, der deine IBM Quantum&reg; Instanz und QPU benennt |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login-Knoten und Rechenknoten | Dein IBM Cloud&reg; API-Schlüssel, Instanzen und Backends für QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Führe jeden Befehl in einem Terminal auf dem Login-Knoten aus, sofern der Schritt nichts anderes angibt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Voraussetzungen {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Slurm cluster with OpenMPI, PMIx, and the QRMI SPANK plugin, which the cluster\n"
"administrator installs. The following guides describe these components:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ein Slurm-Cluster mit OpenMPI, PMIx und dem QRMI-SPANK-Plugin, die der Cluster-\n"
"Administrator installiert. Die folgenden Anleitungen beschreiben diese Komponenten:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[SPANK-Plugin für QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin user guide](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"
msgstr "[Benutzerhandbuch zum SPANK-Plugin](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A home directory and a work directory that the login node and the compute nodes see at\n"
"the same absolute paths\n"
msgstr ""
"Ein Home-Verzeichnis und ein Arbeitsverzeichnis, die der Login-Knoten und die Rechenknoten unter\n"
"denselben absoluten Pfaden sehen\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Ausgehender HTTPS-Zugriff auf GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum und Prefect Cloud vom Login-\n"
"Knoten sowie auf IBM Quantum von den Rechenknoten\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Ein IBM Quantum Platform Konto mit einem IBM Cloud API-Schlüssel und mindestens einer Instanz\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Ein Prefect-Cloud-Konto oder ein Prefect-Server, den du selbst hostest\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, C- und C++-Compiler, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK und MPI auf dem Cluster, für die Solver-\n"
"Builds des Tutorials\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Beispiele verwenden die Slurm-Partition `normal` und die Rechenknoten `c1` und `c2`. Ersetze\n"
"sie durch die Namen deines Clusters.\n"

