#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Schritt 1: Am Login-Knoten anmelden {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Schritt 2: uv installieren {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Installiere den Paketmanager [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) und prüfe die Installation:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Schritt 3: Pfade festlegen und das Arbeitsverzeichnis erstellen {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Diese Anleitung und die Tutorials verwenden zwei Umgebungsvariablen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variable | Beispiel | Zweck |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Der qcsc-prefect-Checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | Das Arbeitsverzeichnis der Solver-Jobs und der QRMI-Jobs |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Beide Pfade müssen auf Speicher liegen, den die Rechenknoten unter demselben absoluten Pfad sehen. Wenn\n"
"dein Cluster kein Verzeichnis `/shared` hat, wähle einen anderen gemeinsamen Pfad.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setze die Variablen und erstelle das Arbeitsverzeichnis. Setze die Variablen in jeder neuen\n"
"Shell erneut, bevor du einem Tutorial folgst:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Um die Variablen in jeder neuen Shell automatisch zu setzen, füge sie zu `~/.bashrc` hinzu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Schritt 4: qcsc-prefect klonen {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Klone das Repository und checke ein Release-Tag aus, zum Beispiel `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Schritt 5: Die Workflow-Umgebung erstellen {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Erstelle die Workflow-Umgebung mit Python 3.12 und aktiviere sie:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Installiere die qcsc-prefect-Pakete. Die Option `--no-deps` behält die exakten Versionsbindungen\n"
"zwischen den Paketen des Checkouts bei. Das Tutorial installiert den Workflow selbst:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Prüfe, ob die Befehle verfügbar sind:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere `~/venv/qcsc-host` in jeder neuen Shell auf dem Login-Knoten.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Schritt 6: Bei Prefect anmelden {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Melde dich bei Prefect Cloud an. Wähle **Paste an API key**, füge einen Prefect-Cloud-API-Schlüssel ein und\n"
"wähle deinen Workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Prüfe die Verbindung. Die Ausgabe zeigt `PREFECT_API_URL` und deinen Workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: eigenen Prefect-Server verwenden\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Überspringe diesen Hinweis, wenn du Prefect Cloud verwendest. Um statt Prefect\n"
"Cloud deinen eigenen Prefect-Server zu verwenden, folge\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/)\n"
"und setze die Adresse deines Servers anstelle von `<server-host>` ein:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Schritt 7: Die IBM Quantum-Zugangsdaten speichern {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Führe `qcsc-qrmi login` nach dem Prefect-Login aus, weil der Befehl den Block `qrmi-runtime` speichert:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Beantworte die Eingabeaufforderungen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Füge deinen IBM-Cloud-API-Schlüssel ein. Der Schlüssel wird nicht angezeigt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Drücke die Eingabetaste, um alle Instanzen zu verwenden.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Gib die Nummer der Standardinstanz ein, im folgenden Beispiel `1`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr "Gib die Nummer oder den Namen des Standard-Backends ein, im folgenden Beispiel `4` (`ibm_kingston`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der Befehl gibt außerdem einen Hinweis zu den Rechenknoten und `[qrmi]`-Zeilen für\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml` aus, die das Beispiel auslässt (`...`). Du brauchst die `[qrmi]`-Zeilen nicht,\n"
"weil der Workflow die Instanz und das Backend aus dem Block `qrmi-runtime` liest.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "Der Befehl `qcsc-qrmi` hat die folgenden Unterbefehle:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Befehl | Zweck |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Den API-Schlüssel, die Instanzen und die Backends speichern und den Block sichern |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Die Instanzen und Backends mit dem gespeicherten Schlüssel erneut ermitteln |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Die Instanzen und Backends ohne den Schlüssel ausgeben |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Prüfen, ob die Instanz des Blocks ihr Backend verwenden kann |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Die Datei auf den Rechenknoten installieren {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Das SPANK-Plugin liest `qrmi_config.json` auf jedem Rechenknoten, und zwar vom Pfad in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, oft `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Bitte deinen Cluster-Administrator,\n"
"deine `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` unter diesem Pfad zu installieren. Installiere sie nach jedem\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` oder `qcsc-qrmi refresh` erneut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lass **Session Mode** des Blocks `qrmi-runtime` auf `batch`, weil das SPANK-Plugin\n"
"die QPU im batch mode belegt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Schritt 8: Die Umgebung für die Rechenknoten erstellen {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Der QRMI-Worker läuft auf einem Rechenknoten in einer eigenen Umgebung. Erstelle sie aus demselben\n"
"Checkout. Die Option `--python` hält `~/venv/qcsc-host` aktiv:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Das Paket `qrmi[ibm]` stellt den Befehl `task_runner` bereit. Das Tutorial fügt dieser Umgebung den SQD-\n"
"Kompilierungs-Hook hinzu und verwendet `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` als\n"
"`python_executable` von `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Schritt 9: Die Einrichtung überprüfen {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Prüfe, ob der Block `qrmi-runtime` existiert:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Prüfe die gespeicherten Instanzen und Backends. Der Befehl gibt den Schlüssel nie aus:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Prüfe, ob die Standardinstanz das Standard-Backend verwenden kann:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Prüfe, ob Slurm einen Job auf beiden Rechenknoten ausführt, auch mit PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Prüfe die Umgebung für die Rechenknoten und das Arbeitsverzeichnis auf einem Rechenknoten. Der erste\n"
"Befehl gibt nichts aus, wenn die Importe gelingen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lies [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/),\n"
"um die Knoten, Ranks und Threads der Solver-Jobs zu wählen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
